<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan starts Bankinter.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan starts Bankinter.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Bankinter was rated &quot;buy&quot; as analysts at JP Morgan started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>JP Morgan analyst Carlos Pertejo said Bankinter was the most efficient Spanish bank and set a 12-month price target of 22,500 pesetas on the stock.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
